meta {
  name: saveBrand
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: https://{{customer}}.{{domain}}/jsonrpc
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "saveBrand",
    "params": {
      "brand_name": "Acme",
      "external_brand_id": "ACME"
    },
    "id": 1
  }
}

docs {
  Create or update a brand

  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |---|---|---|---|
  | `brand_id` | integer (nullable) | no | Internal ID of the brand; omit to create a new brand |
  | `external_brand_id` | string (nullable) | no | Your system's reference ID for the brand |
  | `brand_name` | string (nullable) | no | Display name of the brand |
  | `brand_image_base64` | string (nullable) | no | Base64-encoded logo image for the brand |

  **Example: Create a brand**. Omit brand_id to create; provide it to update an existing brand.

  ```json
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "saveBrand",
    "params": {
      "brand_name": "Acme",
      "external_brand_id": "ACME"
    },
    "id": 1
  }
  ```

  Result:

  ```json
  {
    "brand_id": 42
  }
  ```
}
